        "answer": {
          "short": "$2^{\\frac35}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(2^{\\frac13}\\right)^2\\times2^{\\frac13}\\times2^{-\\frac25}&=2^{\\frac23}\\times2^{\\frac13}\\times2^{-\\frac25}\\\\\\left(2^{\\frac13}\\right)^2\\times2^{\\frac13}\\times2^{-\\frac25}&=2^{\\frac23+\\frac13-\\frac25}\\\\\\left(2^{\\frac13}\\right)^2\\times2^{\\frac13}\\times2^{-\\frac25}&=2^{1-\\frac25}\\\\\\left(2^{\\frac13}\\right)^2\\times2^{\\frac13}\\times2^{-\\frac25}&=2^{\\frac35}\\end{align*}$$",
